 "answer_raw": "The newest lineup is the **iPhone Duo**, which arrived at Apple Stores worldwide in October 2026 [1].\n\nSpecific pricing for the Duo is not listed in the available reports, so you would need to check the Apple Store directly for the current MSRP [1].\n\nUpgrading from an iPhone 14 is likely worth it if you want access to Apple's newest on-device intelligence and better battery life [2]. While the iPhone 14 is still functional for basic tasks, its battery capacity is often significantly degraded by own age [2][3]. Moving to a newer model addresses the hardware limitations and the performance gaps that occur when running modern system features [3].",
